              "exact_quote": "In the short run the IS‑LM framework can be applied with nominal prices fixed, extending it to an open economy by adding the exchange rate as a variable."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0069",
              "exact_quote": "Before adding the exchange rate, the model has two endogenous variables: output and the interest rate."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "CON_0017",
              "exact_quote": "The exchange rate is treated as an endogenous variable in the model."
            },
            {
              "note_id": "FCT_0068",
              "exact_quote": "If consumer confidence goes up, then aggregate demand goes up."
